+// every other thread waits). The waiting-state filter of ppu_code_line skipped it, so the
+// loop it runs and the words it tests were never seen. Its loop around lr (the call
+// returns there), r13-r31 and, for each that is a readable guest address, 16 bytes there.
+bool is_polling_call(const char* function)
+{
+	return function && (std::strcmp(function, "sys_timer_usleep") == 0 || std::strcmp(function, "sys_timer_sleep") == 0 ||
+		std::strcmp(function, "sys_ppu_thread_yield") == 0);
